### Case: isolation — THE CASE THAT MATTERS.
###
### Send this at the same moment the Free app is returning 429. A DIFFERENT app,
### subscribed to a DIFFERENT product, must still get 200.
###
### {{PRO_KEY}} MUST belong to a separate app from {{FREE_KEY}}. Quota is counted
### per app (the credential), so two keys on one app share a bucket and correct
### isolation will look broken. verify.sh refuses to run if the keys are identical.
###
### Expect 200. Cases 1-4 prove a limit exists; only this one proves the blast
### radius is a single app, which is the entire business case.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/orders
apikey: {{PRO_KEY}}
accept: application/json
